### TEST 1 - Successful registration (Expected: 200 OK)
POST https://localhost:7067/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "registration.success02@example.com",
  "password": "Giulia123!",
  "confirmPassword": "Giulia123!"
}

### TEST 2 - Duplicate email (Expected: 409 Conflict)
POST https://localhost:7067/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "giulia@example.com",
  "password": "Giulia123!",
  "confirmPassword": "Giulia123!"
}

### TEST 3 - Invalid email format (Expected: 400 Bad Request)
POST https://localhost:7067/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "giuliaexample.com",
  "password": "Giulia123!",
  "confirmPassword": "Giulia123!"
}

### TEST 4 - Password confirmation mismatch (Expected: 400 Bad Request)
POST https://localhost:7067/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test.password@example.com",
  "password": "Giulia123!",
  "confirmPassword": "Diversa123!"
}